cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Basketball Drop-Impact Simulator"
version: 1.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-20
abstract: >-
  Interactive Jupyter tool that models the floor contact force, contact duration and
  energy conversion when an inflated basketball is dropped (or thrown up or down) onto a
  rigid floor, using an adiabatic gas-spring, thin-shell stiffness and Hunt-Crossley
  damping calibrated to the FIBA rebound test.
authors:
  - family-names: "Hannan"
    given-names: "Tico"
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/ticohannan/basketball-bounce-sim"
url: "https://ticohannan.github.io/basketball-bounce-sim/"
keywords:
  - basketball
  - impact mechanics
  - coefficient of restitution
  - contact time
  - education
